<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Mittens" data-copy-zh="Mittens">Mittens</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Complete the rescue, open Mittens’ room, and follow her guestbook chapters, dreams and Heart-to-Hearts." data-copy-zh="完成营救，为 Mittens 开放房间，再按顺序体验留言簿章节、梦中冒险与谈心。">Complete the rescue, open Mittens’ room, and follow her guestbook chapters, dreams and Heart-to-Hearts.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Mittens at a glance</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Open her room</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Follow the room and guestbook route</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Daily conversation and gifts</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If you get stuck</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">先认识 Mittens</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">怎么开放她的房间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">房间与访客簿路线</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">每天的交谈与礼物</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查这些地方</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">接下来可以查阅</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><h2>Mittens at a glance</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Mittens — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/mittens.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Mittens — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/mittens.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Mittens — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Mittens is an affectionate, playful cat woman with a private room at the <strong>Rose &amp; Thorn</strong>. Her room route begins after a late Fighters Guild rescue. Once she moves in, daily conversation and Teddy gifts support a welcome scene, eight guestbook chapters and three Heart-to-Hearts. Three of the chapters begin as dream-adventure actions.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Open her room</h2><ol><li>Progress through the <strong>Fighters Guild quest board to Quest 26</strong>. This is the final rescue contract, on <strong>normal dungeon Floor 50</strong>. Prepare strong equipment, healing supplies and poison protection before accepting; you cannot flee its boss fight.</li><li>Complete the rescue encounter, including the conversation after the battle. Finish Mittens’ invitation to live with you so her room entrance opens.</li><li>Visit <strong>Rose &amp; Thorn → West Hallway → Enter Mittens’ Room</strong>. Entering the room costs no time. You can report the guild contract separately; her door opens after the rescue conversation.</li></ol><p>Mittens is in her room <strong>all day, every day</strong>. Your first visit starts <strong>Safe at Last</strong> at any hour. Its affection reward is enough to open Teddy gifts; return during the day for the room tour.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Follow the room and guestbook route</h2><p>Work down this sequence. Every row after the welcome needs the earlier chapters and conversations completed. Automatic scenes start when you enter the room; choose the named adventures and Heart-to-Hearts from Mittens’ personal actions.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event or action</th><th scope="col">Relationship at least</th><th scope="col">Start / arrival window</th><th scope="col">How to begin</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Safe at Last</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">00:00–23:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Enter the room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Room with Excellent Taste</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Enter the room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Other Side of the Pillow</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Enter the room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Great Cream Robbery</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Enter the room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Things I Kept</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">06:00–16:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Choose the Heart-to-Heart</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Her Majesty Objects</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">06:00–15:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Choose the adventure</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Moon Can't Fish</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Choose the adventure</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nine Masks, One Cat</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Choose the adventure</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Look at Me When I Ask</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Choose the Heart-to-Heart</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Do Not Disturb, Ever</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Enter the room</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Warm Side of the Bed</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">Intimate (1600)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Choose the Heart-to-Heart</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Exactly Where I Wanted to Be</th><td data-label="Relationship at least">In Love (3000)</td><td data-label="Start / arrival window">06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="How to begin">Enter the room</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Each Heart-to-Heart costs <strong>60 minutes and 20 Energy</strong>. Each dream adventure costs <strong>120 minutes and 25 Energy</strong>. None of these six activities spends Wealth, and each can be completed once. The adventure starting windows are shorter than her ordinary room schedule, so start within the listed window.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Daily conversation and gifts</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Unlock</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Base affection</th><th scope="col">Daily allowance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Mittens</th><td data-label="Unlock">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost">15 min</td><td data-label="Base affection">1</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Teddy Bear</th><td data-label="Unlock">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost">10 min; 1 Teddy</td><td data-label="Base affection">8</td><td data-label="Daily allowance">2</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk and Teddy gifts have separate daily allowances. The table lists base affection before relationship bonuses. Mittens responds well to <strong>Charm 40, Stamina 50 and Perception 40</strong>; <strong>Animal Care</strong> improves her affection gains.</p><p>Continue these visits as the later chapters ask for higher relationship stages. Completed guestbook scenes can be revisited through <strong>EXTRAS</strong>; their completion does not reset for another room reward.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>If you get stuck</h2><dl><dt><strong>I found Mittens in the alleys, but her room is missing.</strong></dt><dd>The earlier guild searches are separate from the late rescue. Complete the Floor 50 encounter for Quest 26 and finish her invitation conversation.</dd><dt><strong>The boss is defeated, but I still cannot enter her room.</strong></dt><dd>Finish the rescue conversation before leaving the encounter. If it remains unfinished, return to normal Floor 50 with Quest 26 active to continue it.</dd><dt><strong>She is present, but the next chapter does not start.</strong></dt><dd>Check the arrival window and the preceding Heart-to-Heart or adventure. Leave and re-enter her room after meeting those conditions.</dd><dt><strong>Her Majesty Objects will not start in the late afternoon.</strong></dt><dd>The adventure must begin before 16:00. The daytime Heart-to-Heart has a different deadline, before 17:00.</dd><dt><strong>The last chapter is missing.</strong></dt><dd>Reach In Love, finish The Warm Side of the Bed, then enter her room between 06:00 and 17:59.</dd><dt><strong>Talk or gifts no longer help today.</strong></dt><dd>Wait for the next game day after the normal allowance. Repeated attempts can upset her and consume gifts.</dd></dl></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">Fighters Guild — contracts and claiming rewards</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon — access and preparation</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn — rooms and navigation</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and affection bonuses</a></li><li><a href="items.html">Items — Teddy gifts and supplies</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><h2>先认识 Mittens</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Mittens 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/mittens.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Mittens 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/mittens.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Mittens 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Mittens 是热情又爱撒娇的猫女，在<strong>玫瑰与荆棘</strong>拥有自己的房间。完成后期的战士公会救援任务后，就能开始她的房间路线：通过日常交谈、赠送泰迪熊，逐步体验欢迎事件、八章访客簿故事与三段谈心。其中三章需要主动选择梦境冒险。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>怎么开放她的房间</h2><ol><li>沿<strong>战士公会任务板推进到第 26 个任务</strong>，前往<strong>普通地下城第 50 层</strong>完成最后的救援委托。接受前准备好装备、恢复补给与毒素防护；这场首领战开始后无法逃跑。</li><li>打完后继续完成救援对话，完整结束邀请 Mittens 与你同住的部分，她的房门才会开放。</li><li>前往<strong>玫瑰与荆棘 → 西走廊 →「进入Mittens的房间」</strong>。进房间不消耗时间。公会的任务报告可以另外提交，不必等交完报告才去拜访。</li></ol><p>入住后，Mittens<strong>每天全天都在房间里</strong>。第一次进门，无论几点都会开始<strong>《终于安全了》</strong>，这段事件的好感奖励足以开放泰迪熊赠礼；接下来在白天回来参观房间。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>房间与访客簿路线</h2><p>依次推进下表。欢迎事件之后，每一步都需要先完成前面的章节、谈心与冒险。自动事件在进入房间时开始；谈心和冒险要点开 Mittens 的个人行动，主动选择同名选项。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件或行动</th><th scope="col">最低关系阶段</th><th scope="col">开始／进入时段</th><th scope="col">开始方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">终于安全了</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">00:00–23:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">进入房间，自动开始</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">品味绝佳的房间</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">进入房间，自动开始</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">枕头的另一边</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">进入房间，自动开始</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">奶油大劫案</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">相识（Acquaintance，50）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">进入房间，自动开始</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我留下的那些东西</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">相识（Acquaintance，50）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">06:00–16:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">选择同名谈心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">女王陛下有异议</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">朋友（Friend，100）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">06:00–15:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">选择同名冒险</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">月亮是个糟糕的钓鱼人</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">亲密朋友（Close Friend，200）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">选择同名冒险</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">九副面具，一只猫</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">选择同名冒险</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我开口时，看着我</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">迷恋（Crush，400）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">选择同名谈心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">请勿打扰，永远</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">浪漫感（Romantic，800）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">18:00–23:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">进入房间，自动开始</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">床上暖和的那一边</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">亲密（Intimate，1600）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">选择同名谈心</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">正是我想待的地方</th><td data-label="最低关系阶段">恋爱中（In Love，3000）</td><td data-label="开始／进入时段">06:00–17:59</td><td data-label="开始方式">进入房间，自动开始</td></tr></tbody></table><p>每段谈心消耗<strong>60 分钟、20 精力</strong>；每次梦境冒险消耗<strong>120 分钟、25 精力</strong>，都不花费财富。这六项活动各完成一次即可。冒险的开始时段比她在房间的时间短，别把全天在场误当成全天都能出发。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>每天的交谈与礼物</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">开放阶段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">基础好感</th><th scope="col">每日次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Mittens 聊天</th><td data-label="开放阶段">陌生人（Stranger，0）</td><td data-label="消耗">15 分钟</td><td data-label="基础好感">1</td><td data-label="每日次数">4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送泰迪熊</th><td data-label="开放阶段">已知（Known，25）</td><td data-label="消耗">10 分钟；1 泰迪熊</td><td data-label="基础好感">8</td><td data-label="每日次数">2</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈与赠送泰迪熊的每日次数分别计算。表中列的是基础好感，实际获得量还会受到关系加成影响。她偏好的属性是<strong>魅力 40、耐力 50、感知 40</strong>，学会<strong>动物照料</strong>也有助于提高收益。</p><p>后期章节需要更高关系阶段时，可以继续安排这些日常拜访。已经完成的访客簿场景可在<strong>EXTRAS</strong>中回看，不会重新开放房间事件的首次奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查这些地方</h2><dl><dt><strong>已经在后巷找到过她，为什么还没有房间？</strong></dt><dd>前期的公会寻人任务与后期救援分别推进。需要完成第 26 个任务在第 50 层的救援事件，以及后面的同住邀请。</dd><dt><strong>首领已经打赢，房门仍未开放。</strong></dt><dd>还要完整结束救援对话。若对话尚未完成，保持第 26 个任务进行中，回普通第 50 层继续事件。</dd><dt><strong>她在房间里，下一章却没有开始。</strong></dt><dd>核对进入时段，以及前一段谈心或冒险是否已经完成。条件满足后，离开并重新进入她的房间。</dd><dt><strong>下午还能谈心，却无法开始《女王陛下有异议》。</strong></dt><dd>这场冒险须在 16:00 前开始；白天谈心的截止时间另为 17:00。</dd><dt><strong>最后一章没有出现。</strong></dt><dd>达到恋爱中，完成「床上暖和的那一边」，再于 06:00–17:59 进入房间。</dd><dt><strong>今天继续交谈或送礼不再有效。</strong></dt><dd>达到通常次数后，等下一个游戏日再来。反复尝试可能让她不高兴，也可能消耗礼物。</dd></dl></section>
<section id="zh-related"><h2>接下来可以查阅</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">战士公会：委托与领取奖励</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城：进入条件与准备</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">玫瑰与荆棘：房间与通行</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系：阶段与好感加成</a></li><li><a href="items.html">道具：泰迪熊与补给</a></li></ul></section>
